=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c16c3dd943e2288c\" href=\"?note=c16c3dd943e2288c\" title=\"56-df-left-normal\">56-df-left-normal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a238253009869a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1ac2af2b5f2884da\" href=\"?note=1ac2af2b5f2884da\" title=\"56-df-reduction-strategy\">56-df-reduction-strategy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Example 4.9.7(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"133"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 的定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,A,B,C,D\">\\(F,A,B,C,D\\)</span> 为两两不同的函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的函数符号集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{F,A,B,C,D\\}\">\\(\\{F,A,B,C,D\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(F)=2\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(F)=2\\)</span>，其余四个符号的元数为0，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为与函数符号集不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>。重写、策略、左正规性与函数迭代见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c16c3dd943e2288c\" href=\"?note=c16c3dd943e2288c\" title=\"56-df-left-normal\">56-df-left-normal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"6a238253009869a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"1ac2af2b5f2884da\" href=\"?note=1ac2af2b5f2884da\" title=\"56-df-reduction-strategy\">56-df-reduction-strategy</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R:=\\{(F(x,B),D),(A,B),(C,C)\\},\\qquad t:=F(C,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R:=\\{(F(x,B),D),(A,B),(C,C)\\},\\qquad t:=F(C,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\to_R F(C,B)\\to_R D\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\to_R F(C,B)\\to_R D\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}^{[n]}(t)=t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}^{[n]}(t)=t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(T,\\to_R,\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(T,\\to_R,\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书例子的规则及起点已逐项核对。左端互不重叠且左线性，故正交；F(x,B)把变量x放在常元B之前，违反左正规。最左红项始终是C，自环使整项不变；先归约右参数A则两步到D。这直接排除了原目录曾有的“仅Church–Rosser足够”的策略定理。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-n